We recommend wrapping the registration in \code{\link[rlang:on_package_load]{rlang::on_package_load()}}
so the pattern is registered whenever \code{{gridpattern}} is loaded
(allowing \code{{gridpattern}} to be in \code{Suggests} and surviving \code{{gridpattern}} being reloaded).
